WEBVTT

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.240
Mitsue-chan.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.330
I became a god.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.210
A god of what?

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.420
I don't know yet.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.050
I just became one last night.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.590
Here's an offering.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.880
I don't want it!

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.890
Gods shouldn't be fussy about food.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.720
You don't believe me, do you?

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:50.900
At any rate, now that I am a god I want 
to know what kind of god I've become.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.610
But, I don't know how to do that.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.200
Right now, you should study for the upcoming test.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.080
I can tell that you don't believe me.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:12.170
Were you talking about god 
just now, Hitotsubashi Yurie-san?

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.920
No, I'll call you Yurie.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.220
Saegusa-san?

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:18.510
Call me Matsuri!

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.890
As of today, we are soul friends!

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:23.220
Nice to meet you, Yurie.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.100
I knew that—

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:29.440
you were a bit different today.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.440
Did you notice it?

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.070
I guess it's because Saegusa's house is also a shrine.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:43.370
You, who forgot your homework and was 
being scolded seemed completely different.

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:45.330
You were full of sanctity!

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.420
Full of sanctity? Was I?!

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.960
You were just acting unashamed.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:56.760
Well, Saegusa-san—

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.470
Call me Matsuri.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.350
Matsuri-chan—

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.230
What am I a god of?

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:09.520
I don't know.

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:14.780
So, since we don't know, let's investigate!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.860
Hey, don't we have to study for the test?

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.280
I'll do it later!

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:21.870
Don't run!

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:47.100
<b>Episode 1     The Spite of Youth</b>

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.020
Why are we on the roof?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.730
Because it's kind of embarrassing if someone sees us.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.410
Am I going to do something embarrassing?

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:03.660
The way to know what kind of god you are,

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.500
is to see what kind of powers you have.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:08.200
How do we do that?

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.040
You should start with a gesture.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.670
Do you remember what TV heroes 
do when they use their powers?

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.710
They pose and shout.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.680
You are quick. Great, my soul friend!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.680
Am I going to do that? Pose or shout?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.270
I don't know!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.640
Then, let's try something you know first.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.530
Don't you feel something?

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.990
Do you have any unusual feelings?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.460
I'm embarrassed—

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.330
You shouldn't be like that!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.920
Put all of your soul and energy in it!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.420
Be more natural!

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.220
I don't know! How?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:04.140
Nothing interesting ever happens to me.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.140
You must think on your own!

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.640
You aren't truly into it yet.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.770
But, I'm embarrassed.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:13.640
You're sweating.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.520
Thank you.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.360
Sign: You are already dead

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.650
What's this?

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.540
Here we go.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.750
Sign: Calligraphy club

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.090
Ninomiya-kun!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:46.890
Sign: Let's try a little harder

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.850
This is wrong!

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.160
Oh, sorry!

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:15.000
When I get into writing, I don't realize someone's there.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.000
Umm—

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.010
I'm Hitotsubashi Yurie.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.380
What year are you?

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.970
I'm in your class.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.140
Ken-chan!

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.930
Why don't you write in your clubroom?

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.690
Since I'm the only member of the calligraphy club—

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:38.350
they took the clubroom away.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.900
But, you don't have to practice on the roof.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.440
But, I feel good being here.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:52.910
Err, did you see what we were doing?

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.370
See what?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.790
Oh, never mind.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.560
Ninomiya-kun is strange.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.520
No, he's a genius!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.160
You're in love.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.660
Ever since she entered middle school—

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.790
Mitsue-chan!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.920
Saegusa-san, are you close to Ninomiya-kun?

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.710
We sometimes ask him to write for us.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.880
At least Ken-chan is very good at calligraphy.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.090
Surely, his calligraphy is quite good.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.090
Ken-chan—

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.970
Yurie, have you heard of this legend?

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:59.850
The day that a strong wind blows, if you confess 
your love on this roof, your love will ripen.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:02.770
Really?!

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.150
I swear to a god!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.400
Why don't you try harder one more time?

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.110
Yes!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:09.820
You're so gullible.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.490
Left: Let's try a little harder - Right: You are already dead

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:15.490
Now! Make the wind!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:16.740
How?

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:19.290
Concentrate all your soul to cast a spell.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:24.420
What should I say?

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.840
Since you are both a god and middle school student,

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.420
Kamichu is good.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.130
It sounds strange.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.300
Just for starters.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:33.850
Come on!

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.930
Pour all your love into it!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.310
Ka—

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:45.820
mi—

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.780
chu!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:15.640
Left: Let's try a little harder - Right: You are already dead

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.340
Nothing changed.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.640
I'm already tired.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.350
Then, we will continue with this after school.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.600
Are we going to do this again?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.900
Let's go to my place. There are some tools too.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.570
Fifth period class is about to start.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.780
What am I going to do about the test?

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:54.180
I'm sorry to make you deal with this.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:57.440
It's all right. But aren't you exhausted?

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:00.600
I feel a little tired, but I'm okay.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.560
I rested during classic literature class.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.850
You shouldn't rest during class.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.240
Welcome to Raifuku Shrine.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.880
I'll go and make some preparations. So, wait a second.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:36.550
No one's here.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:40.550
People don't come to the shrine so often.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.350
I see.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.230
Oh, 85!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.610
85— 85—

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.400
Good luck.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.820
Love relationship is slowly moving forward. Go. Go.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.910
Go— Go—?

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.290
A little luck.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.210
Even though you are a god?

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.960
It's okay as long as I didn't get "unlucky"!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:16.300
Love relationship. Presentment of storm.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.900
This is my little sister, Miko.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.990
Nice to meet you.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.580
My soul friend, and her friend.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.660
I'm Hitotsubashi Yurie.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.210
Shijou Mitsue.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.960
I'm Saegusa Miko.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.590
Thank you for taking care of my sister.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.710
Hey, can you tell what kind of god she is?

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.390
Can she tell?

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.680
She has that sort of ability.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.650
I'm sorry.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:20.950
But, I still feel some strong power from her.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.530
Hey, can't you ask Yashima-sama?

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.700
He is also a god, so I'm sure he can tell.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.540
I don't think I can right now.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.500
Then, why don't we do the event?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.000
Huh?

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:15.460
Something came to you?

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.590
I'm not sure.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:21.220
You're reacting. Almost there.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.360
What's wrong?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.650
Nothing really.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.250
I'm sorry to have caused you trouble.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.320
Thank you.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.820
Don't worry about it. Just rest up.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:26.990
Yes.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.660
Well, see you later.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:29.870
Are you leaving already?

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.490
Do you want to join us for dinner?

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:34.080
Thank you. But I have to make dinner at home.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:38.670
Shou-chan, can you put Yuri-chan's bicycle away?

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:42.170
I'm sorry, Tama. Can you let me sleep now?

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.750
What? Why do I have to do that?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:44.210
Yuri-chan is too exhausted and can't even move.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.180
All right.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.510
I'm sorry, Shou-chan.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:49.600
Shut up!

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.060
Sorry—

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.140
Yuri-chan, do you want to have some tea?

00:13:56.890 --> 00:14:00.520
No, thanks. I'll just sleep until dinnertime.

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:10.200
It's even more delicious: The cola bun has defeated me.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.240
It's 6:30 in the evening!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.290
Today, we will be preempting our regular program—

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:18.290
to broadcast information on the impending typhoon.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:22.130
The Meteorological Agency has just announced a small typhoon, "Yurie",

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:25.880
which has formed off the shores of Tokunoshima.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:23.880
That's me!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:30.180
According to meteorologists, typhoon "Yurie" won't cause heavy rainfall,

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.260
Hello?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.260
but its winds are strong.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.550
It's you!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:33.560
It's forecasted to be moving at speeds of 90 kilometers.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:33.560
Mitsue!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.230
You really became a god.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:38.270
The local meteorological station issued a high sea and gale warning in Shikoku—

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.270
That's what I was saying.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.310
"Yurie" will be approaching Honshu soon.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.310
What am I going to do?

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.110
I'm the one who caused this.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.110
Each municipality will be given an evacuation warning,

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.900
I guess it's what we did on 
the roof during the lunch break.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.320
And the designated evacuation routes.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:49.240
Please keep checking the TV or radio for updates.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.240
Kamichu of the strong winds!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.320
I didn't ask anyone to cause this sort of mess.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.320
We've received more information from the Meteorological Agency now.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.200
There were some inquiries about the pictures we showed on the air.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:54.170
Can you go?

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:55.200
Let's meet at school.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.660
We didn't add any processed visuals to the picture that we aired.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:57.660
Yes!

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.500
Oh, Shou-chan!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.510
Good timing!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.590
Hey, Yurie!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.510
Sorry about this.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.550
Thanks!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.470
What's going on?

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:15.890
I'm going to school!

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.610
The typhoon is approaching.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.860
Please shut your doors and windows,

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.570
and try not to go outside unless absolutely necessary.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.450
Wait!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.620
I'm going to be crushed!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.250
I'll be torn off!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.380
We'll be blown away!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:53.140
The typhoon is coming!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.640
I guess it's all because of my power—

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.430
If that comes here—

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.840
Yurie!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.810
I knew you'd come.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.230
How did you know?

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.060
Because you are my soul friend.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:47.020
You are trying to stop the typhoon, aren't you?

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.110
Good!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:55.240
The Raifuku Shrine will give you any needed support!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.700
Help us!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.160
Mitsue-chan!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:08.250
The typhoon's destination is here.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.000
You are the only one who can stop it!

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:12.970
I'll do my best.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.010
Do your best.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.320
Please, Mr. Typhoon—

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.200
Disappear.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.700
Please disappear!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:43.330
Disappear!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:45.750
Disappear!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:03.770
Are you all right?

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.290
This is impossible.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.170
I'm a god.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.420
Why can't I do anything?!

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.190
Ninomiya-kun!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:54.820
It can't be!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.190
He's still here?

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:56.780
Yurie!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.530
My clubroom!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.700
Ninomiya-kun!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.880
Ninomiya-kun!

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.470
<i>I want to save him!</i>

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:26.920
<i>Ninomiya-kun.</i>

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.760
<i>I want to save him!</i>

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:30.850
Ka—

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.310
mi—

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.310
chu!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.880
Ninomiya-kun!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:06.760
Kenji-kun!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.120
I'm flying—

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.250
This is awesome!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:26.840
<i>The day a strong wind blows, 
if I'd confess my love on the roof—</i>

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:32.850
I love you—

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.320
They fell.

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:49.910
Yurie!

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:59.080
Yurie, are you all right?

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.340
Ken-chan?

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.340
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.340
Are you alive?

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:05.800
Yes!

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:10.800
So cold.

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:22.650
Oh—

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:24.360
Umm—

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:30.820
What I just said was—

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.000
Who are you?

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:43.130
God, you idiot!

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:58.690
Which part was the dream?

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:09.530
Almost noon!

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:25.100
Oh, this is so tiring.

00:23:25.100 --> 00:23:26.420
Here! Here we go!

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:31.430
Everything was real.

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:34.390
Good morning!

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:37.220
Yurie-chan! I heard that you became a god.

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:39.270
Well, yeah.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:45.070
Middle school girl god! Yurie makes her debut!

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:45.070
Sleeping in classes, and coming late.

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:47.780
You haven't changed at all, 
even after you became a god.

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:49.360
It doesn't matter.

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:51.030
Her image is all that matters!

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:55.740
For the first time in history, 
a middle school girl is a god!

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:57.700
This will be a hit!

00:23:58.160 --> 00:23:58.790
A hit?

00:23:58.790 --> 00:23:59.660
Hey!

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:02.500
The trash. I have to bring it to the incinerator.

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:13.010
Let's see— Ichihashi-san?

00:24:14.140 --> 00:24:15.430
It's Hitotsubashi!

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:17.140
Right.

00:24:18.970 --> 00:24:19.930
See you later.

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:32.280
A little luck

00:24:32.570 --> 00:24:34.110
Is there still some hope?

00:24:34.490 --> 00:24:36.990
Ken is extraordinarily slow to realize it.

00:24:37.870 --> 00:24:38.620
It's all right.

00:24:39.310 --> 00:24:41.870
At least he remembered my name.

00:24:42.620 --> 00:24:44.580
Well, he really didn't—

00:24:46.630 --> 00:24:48.500
<i>Let's take this step by step.</i>

00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:50.800
<i>And once again—</i>

00:24:51.510 --> 00:24:53.130
Hey, god!

00:24:54.550 --> 00:24:58.300
Our net fell down, can you fix it?

00:24:59.060 --> 00:25:00.720
Don't depend on me so easily!

00:25:00.720 --> 00:25:03.180
A god can have a tough time too!

00:25:09.830 --> 00:25:15.890
<b>mada mada zenzen owannai last ichijikan no jugyou desu</b>

00:25:09.830 --> 00:25:15.890
<b>The last class of the day never seems to end</b>

00:25:15.890 --> 00:25:20.770
<b>tokei wo chira chira mitemo ichi byou ga nagai ne</b>

00:25:15.890 --> 00:25:20.770
<b>Even if I keep glancing at my watch, a second seems an eternity</b>

00:25:21.790 --> 00:25:27.830
<b>mabushii koutei mieru kimi no hashiru sugata oikake</b>

00:25:21.790 --> 00:25:27.830
<b>In the radiant schoolyard, trailing your running visage,</b>

00:25:27.830 --> 00:25:32.990
<b>houkago love-love date mousou shite bosou chuu</b>

00:25:27.830 --> 00:25:32.990
<b>my imagination is running wild about our date after class</b>

00:25:33.870 --> 00:25:36.890
<b>chime no kane koi no signal</b>

00:25:33.870 --> 00:25:36.890
<b>The school chimes ring and it's a signal of love!</b>

00:25:36.890 --> 00:25:39.880
<b>rouka no tobidashi ni wa chuui</b>

00:25:36.890 --> 00:25:39.880
<b>Be careful if you rush out into the hallway!</b>

00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:42.860
<b>kimi no moto e ichiban saki ni</b>

00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:42.860
<b>I dash to see you, first thing!</b>

00:25:42.860 --> 00:25:45.470
<b>issho ni kaerou</b>

00:25:42.860 --> 00:25:45.470
<b>Let's go home together!</b>

00:25:46.450 --> 00:25:53.110
<b>soda aji no ice candy gira gira na ohisama no shita hanbunko</b>

00:25:46.450 --> 00:25:53.110
<b>Sharing a soda-flavored popsicle under the glaring sun</b>

00:25:53.110 --> 00:25:59.150
<b>torokesou na atashi no seishun desu doki doki shichau</b>

00:25:53.110 --> 00:25:59.150
<b>My youth seems to melt with it, it makes my heart beat faster</b>

00:25:59.150 --> 00:26:04.600
<b>kono nanigenai toki wo ima mune ni shimatte</b>

00:25:59.150 --> 00:26:04.600
<b>I'm shutting our casual time in my heart</b>

00:26:04.900 --> 00:26:12.040
<b>asu wa mata kyou yori mo kimi wo suki ni naru no desu</b>

00:26:04.900 --> 00:26:12.040
<b>Tomorrow I will love you even more than today</b>

00:26:16.230 --> 00:26:31.230
<b>Preview</b>

00:26:16.800 --> 00:26:21.100
Umm, when a god has a 
problem, who should they consult?

00:26:21.760 --> 00:26:22.650
Father?

00:26:22.650 --> 00:26:23.790
Mother?

00:26:23.790 --> 00:26:24.650
Teacher?

00:26:26.140 --> 00:26:31.230
<b>Please god</b>

00:26:26.730 --> 00:26:30.360
Anyhow, the next episode is 
"Please god". A "Chu!" to you!
